{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The beloved Playdate platformer is now available on Steam!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">engadget - best playdate games of 2025 list, &quot;Summit is an incredible precision platformer for Playdate that\u2019ll hit you right in the feels&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lonelybrand -\u00a0\u201cSummit stands as proof of indie games\u2019 capability to offer both challenging gameplay and moving storytelling.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/extras/MAIN_LIBRARY_IMAGE__Or_cover__SUMMIT.png?t=1742584127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Summit : Steps of Solace\u00a0</strong>is an <strong>exhilarating</strong> mountain climbing game that requires <strong>precision platforming</strong>. Players embark on an epic journey to conquer the mountain by overcoming puzzle platforming obstacles and mastering climbing techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Equipped with 2 pickaxes, scale the mountain to reach the top. Avoid physics based environmental hazards as you uncover the story behind our protagonist\u2019s unwavering tenacity to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will <strong>you</strong> reach the summit?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534850?t=1742584127","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/b201bd5349a2e51000dbc5f9fde0b84e0c6e801c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742584127","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/27d58019a32fbd177f2211c20196e8e7b620471f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742584127","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534850/27d58019a32fbd177f2211c20196e8e7b620471f/capsul